1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,030
Where is Captain Alison going and how?
艾利森船长要去哪儿，怎么去？

2
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:17,260
Where is Captain Alison going and how?
艾利森船长要去哪儿，怎么去？

3
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:25,920
Our neighbour, Captain Charles Alison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow.
我们的邻居查尔斯·艾利森船长明天就要从朴次茅斯启航了。

4
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:30,820
We'll meet him at the harbour early in the morning.
明天一大早我们将在码头为他送行。

5
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:34,250
He will be in his small boat, Topsail.
他将乘坐他的“涛波赛”号小艇。

6
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:39,280
Topsail is a famous little boat.
“涛波赛”号是艘有名的小艇。

7
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:43,870
It has sailed across the Atlantic many times.
它已经多次横渡大西洋。

8
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:49,040
Captain Alison will set out at eight o'clock,
艾利森船长将于8点钟启航，

9
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:52,130
so we'll have plenty of time.
因此我们有充裕的时间。

10
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:56,850
We'll see his boat and then we'll say goodbye to him.
我们将参观他的船，然后和他告别。

11
00:00:57,910 --> 00:00:59,940
He will be away for two months.
他要离开两个月。

12
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,900
We are very proud of him.
我们真为他感到自豪。

13
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:07,870
He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic.
他将参加一次重大的横渡大西洋的比赛。
